In a Page Object Model (POM) framework, you have a login page class. Which approach correctly implements the page factory pattern?

```java
public class LoginPage {
    WebDriver driver;
    // Option A
    @FindBy(id = "username")
    WebElement usernameField;

    public LoginPage(WebDriver driver) {
        this.driver = driver;
        PageFactory.initElements(driver, this);
    }
}
```

